  "bio": "Nestled in the heart of Curitiba, Brazil, A Magia Tatuagem is a beloved institution, esteemed as the largest tattoo, piercing, and barbershop in PR for over 20 years. Infused with striking floral artistry, it's a studio that marries passion, craft and the finest brands to create your perfect, enchanting design. Orders can be placed online for home delivery, reflecting their commitment to customer convenience and satisfaction.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Curitiba, Parana, Brazil\n\n• +28 anos no ramo da tatuagem e piercing🧞‍♂️\n• Instituto da Tatuagem e Atelier campestre \n📦 Peça no whatsapp e receba em Casa 👇",
